<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="3in" height="3in" viewBox="0 0 300 300" role="img" aria-labelledby="title desc">
<title id="title">Aerosol yield and particle sizes in the Manchester ternary mixture</title>
<desc id="desc">Run 24 contains α-pinene, o-cresol and isoprene. At ${consumed} µg/m³ total precursor consumed, the digitized wall-corrected yield is ${observed}%. The additive estimate from Voliotis et al.’s single-precursor fits is ${additive}% using the run 24 modeled precursor split. The bulk Particula mass-and-number fit gives ${modeled}%. Separately, at two hours the Manchester number spectrum read from Wang et al. Figure S1a and the Particula refit both peak in the 126–158 nm bin. Both curves use the Particula particle-resolved model. The dashed curve retains the earlier bulk mass-fit chemistry and initial particle parameters. It peaks higher, in the next larger bin. The solid curve refits chemistry and particle parameters using size distributions alongside mass, counts and water uptake. Points are read from the published heatmap, with a contour interval of approximately 5,000 particles per cubic centimetre per decade of diameter. Lines connect model bin means. The refit used this spectrum for calibration.</desc>
<rect width="300" height="300" fill="#FBF2E3"/>
<g font-family="Liberation Sans, Arial, sans-serif" fill="#243E43">
<text x="14.00" y="28.00" font-size="20" font-weight="700" fill="#243E43" text-anchor="start">Manchester chamber</text>
<text x="14.00" y="48.00" font-size="12" font-weight="400" fill="#243E43" text-anchor="start">α-pinene + o-cresol + isoprene</text>
<g transform="translate(215 -6) scale(.56)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 39 L45 26 L124 26 L100 39 Z" fill="#EFD1A5" stroke="#243E43" stroke-width="2"/>
<path d="M100 39 L124 26 L124 88 L100 102 Z" fill="#CAD9D2" stroke="#243E43" stroke-width="2"/>
<path d="M21 39 L100 39 L100 102 L21 102 Z" fill="#FBF2E3" stroke="#243E43" stroke-width="2"/>
<path d="M27 44 L32 93 L91 96 L95 44" fill="#CAD9D2" fill-opacity=".51" stroke="#617679" stroke-width="1"/>
<path d="M38 29 L52 22 L104 22 L91 29 Z" fill="#FBF2E3" stroke="#243E43" stroke-width="1.6"/>
<path d="M46 45 l-3 8 M62 45 l-3 8 M78 45 l-3 8" stroke="#A44D21" stroke-width="1.6"/>
<path d="M32 103 v5 M90 103 v5 M119 92 v4" stroke="#243E43" stroke-width="2"/>
<circle cx="39" cy="71" r="2.5" fill="#135963"/>
<circle cx="50" cy="58" r="1.6" fill="#135963"/>
<circle cx="59" cy="79" r="3.2" fill="#135963"/>
<circle cx="70" cy="64" r="2.1" fill="#135963"/>
<circle cx="82" cy="84" r="2.7" fill="#135963"/>
<circle cx="86" cy="57" r="1.5" fill="#135963"/>
<circle cx="46" cy="87" r="1.4" fill="#135963"/>
<circle cx="72" cy="90" r="1.25" fill="#135963"/>
<circle cx="52" cy="68" r="1" fill="#135963"/>
<circle cx="81" cy="73" r="1.1" fill="#135963"/>
</g>
<text x="14" y="74" font-size="13" font-weight="700" fill="#243E43" text-anchor="start">Wall-corrected yield</text>
<text x="286" y="74" font-size="11" font-weight="400" fill="#243E43" text-anchor="end">at ${consumed} µg/m³ consumed</text>
<text x="44" y="98" font-size="19" font-weight="700" fill="#243E43" text-anchor="middle">${observed}%</text>
<text x="44" y="112" font-size="11" font-weight="400" fill="#243E43" text-anchor="middle">Chamber</text>
<text x="146" y="98" font-size="19" font-weight="700" fill="#243E43" text-anchor="middle">${additive}%</text>
<text x="146" y="112" font-size="11" font-weight="400" fill="#243E43" text-anchor="middle">Single-precursor fits</text>
<text x="248" y="98" font-size="19" font-weight="700" fill="#135963" text-anchor="middle">${modeled}%</text>
<text x="248" y="112" font-size="11" font-weight="400" fill="#135963" text-anchor="middle">Particula bulk fit</text>
<text transform="translate(16 196) rotate(-90)" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle">Particles/cm³ per decade</text>
<g transform="translate(13 0)">
<line x1="40.00" y1="245.00" x2="271.00" y2="245.00" stroke="#CFD1C7" stroke-width="0.8" stroke-dasharray="none"/>
<text x="32.00" y="249.00" font-size="11" font-weight="400" fill="#243E43" text-anchor="end">0</text>
<line x1="40.00" y1="197.00" x2="271.00" y2="197.00" stroke="#CFD1C7" stroke-width="0.8" stroke-dasharray="none"/>
<text x="32.00" y="201.00" font-size="11" font-weight="400" fill="#243E43" text-anchor="end">20k</text>
